SUMMARY
-------

The templates this site was built on are free, and you can download them
yourself from BootstrapMade at the links below. They have been heavily
modified here, and those modifications are not free to reuse.

The writing, research figures, resume and CV content, reworked
navigation, and the custom code in this repository are my own work. No
permission is granted to copy, modify, redistribute or republish any of it.

If you would like to use something here, ask me: francisco@batsandbytes.com


WHAT IS MINE
------------

All rights reserved on the following. No license is granted, and none is
implied by this repository being public:

  - All written content: biography, research descriptions, project
    descriptions, resume and all entries therein.

  - All scientific figures, plots and diagrams in assets/img/, including the
    portfolio figures. These are my own research output. They may not be
    reused, modified or redistributed without prior written permission.

  - All modifications made to the original template, including:

      the custom CSS in assets/css/style.css and the custom JavaScript in
      assets/js/main.js;

      the portfolio paging and filtering;

      the figure slider on the project detail pages, which the original
      template shipped without ever starting, together with the navigation
      arrows and the cyan paging controls that move with them;

      the lightbox caption rework, which nests the caption inside the media
      box so it lines up with the image at any aspect ratio;

      the contact form integration and its captcha handling.

    The navigation is the exception within this list. Its structure, styling
    and scrollspy behaviour come from the MyResume template credited below.
    What is mine there is the adaptation: the menu entries, the
    colours, and the integration with the rest of this site.

Forking this repository on GitHub is permitted by GitHub's Terms of Service,
yet no permission is granted to reuse this material in your own project,
published or otherwise.


WHAT IS NOT MINE
----------------

These components belong to their authors and remain under their own licenses.
Nothing in this file claims any right over them, and nothing here restricts
your use of them. You can freely obtain them from their own sources,
not from this repository.

  iPortfolio template, v3.7.0 — BootstrapMade
    https://bootstrapmade.com/iportfolio-bootstrap-portfolio-websites-template/
    The base this site is built on, heavily modified here. Download it from
    the link above rather than copying it out of this repository.

  MyResume template — BootstrapMade
    https://bootstrapmade.com/free-html-bootstrap-template-my-resume/
    The site navigation comes from this template: the header layout, the
    navmenu markup and styling, the CSS custom property naming, and the
    navmenuScrollspy function in assets/js/main.js, which is used unchanged.

  Both templates are licensed under https://bootstrapmade.com/license/
    Free to use. The free tier is for personal projects and requires the
    "Designed by BootstrapMade" credit to stay in the footer, which it does.

  Isotope — Metafizzy
    Licensed GPLv3 for open source use. A commercial license is required for
    commercial use. Used here under the GPLv3 terms.
    https://isotope.metafizzy.co/

  MIT licensed, each under its own copyright:
    Bootstrap, Bootstrap Icons, Swiper, AOS, GLightbox, imagesLoaded,
    PureCounter, Waypoints, Typed.js, Boxicons

  Academicons — loaded from jsDelivr for the ORCID, Google Scholar and
    ResearchGate icons. SIL OFL 1.1 / MIT.

  Web3Forms — https://web3forms.com/
    The contact form posts to their API and is used on their free plan. The
    form markup and the access key in index.html are theirs to define, not
    mine. The service, its API and its terms belong to Web3Forms.

  hCaptcha — https://www.hcaptcha.com/
    The spam check in front of the contact form, delivered through the
    Web3Forms free plan above. The widget and the service are hCaptcha's.

    Both services are used here free of charge under their own terms. Nothing
    in this file claims any right over either of them, and the access key in
    index.html is specific to this site.

  Photographs — Andres Saa, https://andressaa.com/
    Used here with permission. They are his work, not mine, and are not
    covered by the rights reserved above. Do not reuse them without
    written permission.


